WEBVTT

00:05.880 --> 00:08.720
You were sending me signals all this time,

00:09.680 --> 00:11.970
but it took me so long to notice.

00:15.930 --> 00:17.270
<i>Oh… My time is up…</i>

00:18.350 --> 00:20.730
<i>Jin's blood is expiring…</i>

00:23.730 --> 00:25.690
<i>Jin is disappearing…</i>

00:28.070 --> 00:31.030
I can't take the place
of the League of Villains,

00:32.070 --> 00:35.740
but I had to tell you
how lovely your smile is.

00:39.250 --> 00:40.580
Am I…

00:42.000 --> 00:45.040
<i>I love both Izuku and Ochaco, but…</i>

00:47.170 --> 00:48.170
<i>Am I…</i>

00:50.380 --> 00:51.550
cute?

00:53.680 --> 00:55.350
The cutest in the world.

00:59.060 --> 01:01.940
ORIGINAL STORY BY KOHEI HORIKOSHI

03:00.850 --> 03:01.850
That's only fair…

03:02.720 --> 03:04.100
After all, Bubaigawara

03:05.020 --> 03:06.900
was a great guy.

03:08.520 --> 03:09.810
Himiko Toga…

03:18.570 --> 03:20.780
<i>I wielded the knife</i>

03:20.870 --> 03:22.410
<i>in order to become people that I loved,</i>

03:23.410 --> 03:26.000
<i>but somehow,</i>
<i>that turned into anger and hatred.</i>

03:27.250 --> 03:28.750
<i>In order</i>

03:28.830 --> 03:31.710
<i>to make this world</i>
<i>an easier place for me to live in.</i>

03:37.010 --> 03:41.100
<i>I'm feeling the effects of using</i>
<i>Transform to access other people's Quirks.</i>

03:46.430 --> 03:50.060
<i>She's making sure that all the Heroes</i>
<i>who got caught up in her Zero Gravity</i>

03:50.150 --> 03:51.520
<i>land softly and safely.</i>

03:52.770 --> 03:54.440
You got everyone involved,

03:54.530 --> 03:56.900
but you're making sure they land slowly.

03:57.400 --> 03:58.610
Right, Ochaco?

03:59.910 --> 04:02.200
In the end, no matter what happens,

04:02.280 --> 04:03.950
you'll never allow them to fall hard.

04:05.870 --> 04:09.170
<i>I'm cold. I've lost too much blood.</i>

04:09.790 --> 04:12.880
<i>It feels as though</i>
<i>my body and mind are disconnecting.</i>

04:12.960 --> 04:14.840
<i>I can't move at all,</i>

04:15.550 --> 04:17.340
<i>even though I have to move.</i>

04:18.800 --> 04:19.840
<i>I still have to…</i>

04:23.220 --> 04:25.640
<i>I'll give you blood</i>
<i>for the rest of my life!</i>

04:26.720 --> 04:30.770
<i>I had to tell you</i>
<i>how lovely your smile is.</i>

04:34.480 --> 04:35.860
Am I cute?

04:37.490 --> 04:39.150
The cutest in the world.

04:44.330 --> 04:46.490
You're losing so much blood. It's fatal.

04:47.450 --> 04:50.250
It's because you were moving around
even after I had stabbed you.

04:52.710 --> 04:53.880
Ochaco,

04:54.710 --> 04:57.340
the League of Villains
will destroy everything.

04:58.590 --> 05:01.510
Once that task is done…

05:03.140 --> 05:05.220
<i>this world will become</i>
<i>an easier place for me to live in.</i>

05:17.030 --> 05:18.110
But…

05:18.820 --> 05:22.700
what you said to me made me happy.

05:23.200 --> 05:26.740
I said that this was
an all-out battle for survival,

05:31.250 --> 05:35.130
but I just can't allow you to die.

05:37.710 --> 05:40.760
My feelings are genuine and true.

05:43.470 --> 05:44.800
I'll give you

05:45.720 --> 05:47.220
all of my blood.

05:50.560 --> 05:52.190
<i>It's warm.</i>

05:52.770 --> 05:56.980
<i>But I can't allow this. If she does this…</i>

05:57.980 --> 05:59.650
When I almost died last time,

06:00.610 --> 06:03.570
<i>this is how Jin saved my life.</i>

06:04.610 --> 06:06.910
I don't have Jin's blood anymore,

06:06.990 --> 06:09.080
so I will become Ochaco.

06:10.200 --> 06:12.330
As long as I can use someone's Quirk,

06:12.830 --> 06:15.080
my blood turns
into that person's blood too.

06:18.290 --> 06:19.750
If I got caught,

06:20.380 --> 06:24.090
were you planning to come see me
to give me blood until the day I died?

06:28.970 --> 06:30.430
I'm going to close your wounds.

06:31.930 --> 06:33.140
Ochaco,

06:33.730 --> 06:36.850
you should've just kept
to catching Villains.

06:37.980 --> 06:41.440
You should've just eliminated
the deviant maniacs.

06:42.610 --> 06:43.950
You should've

06:44.030 --> 06:47.240
just played the good Hero
and stuck to only doing what's right.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.280
But…

06:52.080 --> 06:53.200
But…

06:54.330 --> 06:57.500
You went on to do more than that…

06:59.290 --> 07:02.000
Thinking about someone who hurt

07:02.090 --> 07:04.300
and stabbed so many of your friends.

07:06.220 --> 07:09.300
You're so strange, Ochaco.

07:10.010 --> 07:13.890
You… too…

07:14.850 --> 07:17.060
I'm going to live as I please.

07:17.690 --> 07:20.190
That's why there's no way
I can let you catch me.

07:20.770 --> 07:23.530
Similar to how
you are determined to catch me.

07:24.570 --> 07:25.400
But…

07:27.110 --> 07:28.910
<i>I'm sorry I stabbed you.</i>

07:30.030 --> 07:31.950
<i>I'm sorry I yelled at you.</i>

07:32.700 --> 07:33.950
I really am.

07:35.250 --> 07:38.620
<i>Toya burned down my house for me.</i>

07:39.380 --> 07:42.500
<i>It was a normal house</i>
<i>filled with horrible memories.</i>

07:43.050 --> 07:45.210
<i>He made it seem like</i>
<i>it never existed to begin with.</i>

07:48.930 --> 07:50.090
It made me happy.

07:51.260 --> 07:52.430
But…

07:53.430 --> 07:56.390
even though the house is gone,
those bad memories are still in my heart.

07:57.230 --> 08:00.230
Ochaco, you didn't try to pretend
like they never existed.

08:00.980 --> 08:03.150
It was painful and difficult to bear,

08:04.570 --> 08:06.440
but when you touched me,

08:07.070 --> 08:08.570
I felt the weight being lifted off,

08:09.660 --> 08:11.570
and my heart became light.

08:13.280 --> 08:15.620
Even if we can't avoid the battle,

08:15.700 --> 08:18.500
I don't want to ignore
what's hidden deep inside him.

08:22.630 --> 08:25.590
Thank you, Ochaco.

08:26.300 --> 08:27.760
You made me happy.

08:28.420 --> 08:30.430
You truly made me happy,

08:31.180 --> 08:32.510
Ochaco.

08:34.890 --> 08:37.310
<i>I wanted to become other people.</i>

08:37.930 --> 08:40.810
<i>I was jealous of them and loved them,</i>

08:40.900 --> 08:42.900
<i>so I drank their blood.</i>

08:43.730 --> 08:46.400
Hi… mi… ko…

08:47.690 --> 08:49.950
Yes.

08:52.450 --> 08:53.620
<i>If I had known</i>

08:54.120 --> 08:56.830
<i>about this feeling sooner…</i>

09:00.160 --> 09:03.210
<i>then maybe I would've wanted</i>
<i>to give my blood,</i>

09:03.710 --> 09:05.750
<i>the same way I wanted to drink blood.</i>

09:08.550 --> 09:11.260
<i>If I had known that kind of love…</i>

09:13.470 --> 09:16.430
<i>I wonder if this world would've been</i>
<i>an easier place to live in.</i>

09:19.140 --> 09:20.560
<i>But…</i>

09:25.190 --> 09:26.980
<i>I'm Himiko Toga.</i>

09:27.820 --> 09:30.740
<i>I wanted to live as I pleased,</i>
<i>and I did just that.</i>

09:31.650 --> 09:35.200
<i>Just a normal girl</i>

09:36.200 --> 09:39.080
<i>with the cutest smile in the whole world.</i>

09:45.670 --> 09:47.090
UA COFFIN IN THE SKY

09:48.750 --> 09:51.170
20 MINUTES BEFORE TOGA'S TWICE ARMY
WAS ELIMINATED

09:52.840 --> 09:55.760
<i>I'm understanding it now, Nighteye.</i>

09:56.930 --> 10:00.020
If you continue like this, you will fight
with a Villain in an all-out war

10:00.100 --> 10:03.390
and end up facing
an unimaginably gruesome death!

10:05.690 --> 10:06.690
<i>A Villain…</i>

10:08.440 --> 10:12.190
<i>You couldn't have known</i>
<i>that this young man is All For One.</i>

10:14.950 --> 10:17.830
<i>If what you predicted</i>
<i>based on Foresight still holds true,</i>

10:17.910 --> 10:19.740
<i>this is most definitely the moment.</i>

10:21.370 --> 10:23.500
I'm here!

10:39.560 --> 10:40.390
<i>In this world,</i>

10:40.970 --> 10:43.730
<i>the strongest ones are</i>
<i>those who are smiling!</i>

10:45.190 --> 10:48.400
I've got to show off my smile.

10:51.360 --> 10:53.820
Armored All Might!

10:59.580 --> 11:01.120
Hercules. Start the camera.

11:01.620 --> 11:03.750
<i>It's already recording.</i>

11:04.330 --> 11:06.580
I'll keep you updated on my battle,

11:07.670 --> 11:08.670
<i>Tsukauchi.</i>

11:09.670 --> 11:13.090
Power Suit and a car as his support items!

11:13.800 --> 11:17.010
All Might versus All For One?

11:17.090 --> 11:18.590
Live stream!

11:19.550 --> 11:21.810
Stop releasing everything online!

11:21.890 --> 11:23.600
Stop uploading like a fiend!

11:25.600 --> 11:27.560
Wait. Where are you going?

11:27.650 --> 11:30.860
-To support everyone.
-Support?

11:31.440 --> 11:32.980
In your current state?

11:34.860 --> 11:37.910
<i>You already chose where to end your life?</i>

11:38.990 --> 11:41.080
<i>No matter how many fancy tools</i>
<i>you pack on,</i>

11:42.030 --> 11:46.080
<i>a Quirkless man can never be a match</i>
<i>for that monster.</i>

11:47.960 --> 11:50.170
Stop streaming, Aiba.

11:51.380 --> 11:52.920
The stream will only display

11:53.750 --> 11:56.510
the destruction of a former Hero

11:57.380 --> 11:58.840
who is trying to steal

11:58.930 --> 12:01.680
a few seconds to a few minutes
from All For One,

12:01.760 --> 12:03.350
<i>so that his students</i>

12:03.850 --> 12:06.230
<i>can continue fighting uninterrupted.</i>

12:08.980 --> 12:10.440
<i>All Might…</i>

12:11.690 --> 12:14.940
<i>You were the biggest inconvenience</i>
<i>in my life</i>

12:15.530 --> 12:18.320
<i>and the best toy worth picking on.</i>

12:18.990 --> 12:22.160
<i>You're trying to stop me?</i>
<i>What a flimsy little plan.</i>

12:22.660 --> 12:24.660
<i>You already know how it'll end.</i>

12:27.160 --> 12:29.960
Why are you laughing!

12:30.500 --> 12:32.460
Hercules, Red Riot.

12:43.930 --> 12:44.850
He withstood that!

12:45.640 --> 12:49.600
<i>Hercules Shield, 66% depleted.</i>

12:49.690 --> 12:51.440
<i>There will be no second time.</i>

12:51.520 --> 12:52.650
No problem!

12:52.730 --> 12:55.400
<i>He kept moving forward without dodging it…</i>

12:55.480 --> 12:57.440
<i>That method of fighting…</i>

12:58.860 --> 13:01.610
only worked because you had One For All!

13:02.410 --> 13:03.620
Blackwhip!

13:07.870 --> 13:09.000
Chargebolt!

13:11.920 --> 13:14.670
<i>The electric shock is interfering</i>
<i>with my regeneration.</i>

13:15.340 --> 13:18.590
Ever since the final battle
with my master,

13:18.670 --> 13:21.300
you always fought
by using erratic, long-range attacks.

13:22.470 --> 13:25.680
You tire your opponent out
and then steal their Quirk.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.060
That style of fighting

13:28.140 --> 13:31.980
only works against people who have Quirks!

13:32.980 --> 13:36.730
Are you still worried
about the live stream, Mr. Police Officer?

13:38.230 --> 13:40.150
<i>I need to remember</i>
<i>what I have witnessed until now…</i>

13:40.860 --> 13:43.320
<i>who has protected us all until now…</i>

13:44.870 --> 13:48.580
I designed and requested to have
this suit and Hercules made

13:49.160 --> 13:52.120
<i>so I could join in the battle,</i>
<i>even for a little bit.</i>

13:52.830 --> 13:56.840
<i>I was once defeated by you</i>
<i>and had to escape to America.</i>

13:57.420 --> 14:00.630
<i>But I made friends there, and this is</i>
<i>the result of that bond created by fate.</i>

14:01.920 --> 14:04.510
I will face you with everything

14:04.590 --> 14:06.640
that I have been given.

14:08.100 --> 14:12.390
I will use my hands
to change fate into any shape I want.

14:12.480 --> 14:16.360
We've known each other for a long time,
so you know me. Right, my friend?

14:17.570 --> 14:20.480
I have never in my life
entered into battle

14:20.570 --> 14:22.860
expecting to lose!

14:24.280 --> 14:27.030
Winding him in. Cellophane!

14:27.910 --> 14:29.200
Build up!

14:30.490 --> 14:31.790
Sugarman.

14:33.540 --> 14:34.920
Shoot Style:

14:37.080 --> 14:38.380
Smash!

14:40.380 --> 14:42.210
This is bringing down my spirit.

14:42.800 --> 14:44.220
I'm in my mid-50s

14:44.300 --> 14:47.180
and bullying a helpless young man.

14:48.260 --> 14:51.600
<i>In order to get One For All,</i>

14:51.680 --> 14:53.810
<i>you chose to harbor deep hatred.</i>

14:54.390 --> 14:56.350
<i>I'll take advantage of that.</i>

14:56.440 --> 14:57.730
<i>That's the only thing</i>

14:57.810 --> 15:00.610
<i>that makes this battle possible.</i>

15:00.690 --> 15:03.070
<i>It's the bond of fate</i>
<i>that ties us together.</i>

15:03.150 --> 15:06.070
A real Demon King would be exasperated.

15:06.160 --> 15:09.030
You can't even stand up
against a Quirkless man.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.490
I'll make sure you're so occupied
that you won't be able

15:11.580 --> 15:13.290
to take your eyes off of me!

15:14.660 --> 15:18.290
<i>Springs plus Brawn Boost plus Cannon plus</i>

15:18.380 --> 15:22.000
<i>Rivet Stab plus Dark Ball plus</i>

15:22.090 --> 15:23.260
<i>Impure Beam!</i>

15:40.730 --> 15:43.530
That was a sloppy combination of attacks.

15:44.360 --> 15:47.990
<i>It's proof that he's becoming agitated.</i>
<i>Keep talking.</i>

15:48.070 --> 15:50.030
<i>Continue agitating him, Toshinori!</i>

15:50.620 --> 15:53.990
<i>Utility Cape Auto-Guard: Tsukuyomi.</i>

15:54.080 --> 15:57.960
<i>Cape is damaged. Left humerus</i>
<i>and clavicle have been crushed.</i>

15:58.040 --> 16:00.380
Set movement assistance to max!

16:01.130 --> 16:03.130
Did you say that you can fight?

16:03.210 --> 16:05.260
Don't get in over your head,

16:05.760 --> 16:07.880
you piece of garbage.

16:08.840 --> 16:13.260
Wearing that trash bag
gave you a big ego, huh?

16:14.010 --> 16:16.480
Your suit will break,
and you'll lose everything.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.640
It won't help you overcome your limits.

16:20.600 --> 16:23.440
Make sure you don't rely on them too much.

16:24.320 --> 16:27.280
I've seen many Heroes
who could no longer exert their powers

16:27.360 --> 16:30.660
after losing their items.

16:31.950 --> 16:33.410
<i>You're serious, young man?</i>

16:36.330 --> 16:39.750
You were planning to win this fight
with just that one stick?

16:44.840 --> 16:47.760
We're seeing eye to eye, my friend.

16:51.470 --> 16:54.890
I wasn't caught off guard
by your plan to buy time.

16:55.510 --> 16:58.850
I just have plenty of time to spend

16:58.930 --> 17:00.850
picking up trash!

17:02.400 --> 17:05.520
Drop the tough guy act already!
It's embarrassing!

17:12.360 --> 17:13.530
<i>Superacid Injection:</i>

17:14.320 --> 17:15.280
<i>Pinky!</i>

17:16.620 --> 17:20.370
Despite the usage of Rewind,
you're now corroding.

17:21.000 --> 17:23.210
All Might!

17:23.290 --> 17:26.800
What did you say about me
being a piece of garbage?

17:30.760 --> 17:32.220
Please let me be your disciple!

17:33.010 --> 17:34.340
Please let me help.

17:34.430 --> 17:38.560
Don't be ridiculous. You're Quirkless,
right? Stop following me.

17:38.640 --> 17:39.930
I'm begging you.

17:40.020 --> 17:42.850
Use your stick to protect
the three-meter radius around you.

17:42.940 --> 17:46.110
My family was killed a long time ago.

17:46.190 --> 17:47.190
Mine too.

17:47.780 --> 17:50.570
I don't have time to help you get revenge.

17:53.110 --> 17:54.240
I just can't stand back

17:55.030 --> 17:57.660
as this world continues to allow
evildoers to take advantage of things.

17:58.490 --> 18:02.000
As a result,
victims' sadnesses turn to hatred.

18:03.040 --> 18:04.540
It's a never-ending downward spiral.

18:05.040 --> 18:08.090
Well? What do you plan to--

18:08.670 --> 18:11.590
I want to make this world into a place
where everyone can live with a smile.

18:12.130 --> 18:14.720
In order to do that,
there needs to be a symbol.

18:17.470 --> 18:18.720
Of what?

18:20.850 --> 18:22.020
Of peace.

18:23.890 --> 18:27.360
Even if it seems like the buildings have
been restored to their former glories,

18:28.020 --> 18:30.440
people are living in fear.

18:31.070 --> 18:33.450
Their hearts are shrouded in darkness.

18:35.950 --> 18:38.780
You're talking about putting on
a grand display of power?

18:39.490 --> 18:42.660
Everyone has their hands full
protecting their own three-meter radius.

18:43.160 --> 18:44.790
That's why I will play the part.

18:46.630 --> 18:50.550
Because I'm Quirkless
and have no role to play.

18:51.760 --> 18:54.260
TATOOIN STATION

19:01.930 --> 19:04.230
All For One has gotten closer to UA!

19:04.310 --> 19:06.230
But he's veered off course.

19:06.980 --> 19:08.230
He's chasing All Might!

19:10.360 --> 19:12.860
<i>Rib fracture, bruising all over the body,</i>

19:13.650 --> 19:15.280
<i>abnormalities with the respiratory system.</i>

19:20.580 --> 19:24.000
Can someone become a Hero
even if they're Quirkless?

19:25.210 --> 19:26.500
<i>I was once</i>

19:27.330 --> 19:29.880
<i>young like that too.</i>

19:33.050 --> 19:34.510
That's the only way

19:34.590 --> 19:37.260
the man called All Might
knows how to live!

19:46.730 --> 19:49.230
<i>He's gotten a little younger.</i>

19:49.730 --> 19:52.020
<i>I wonder if he's aware of it.</i>

19:52.110 --> 19:56.200
<i>I don't want to ask him</i>
<i>and have him come to his senses.</i>

19:56.990 --> 20:00.530
<i>In order to extract the Pinky acid</i>
<i>from his body,</i>

20:00.620 --> 20:04.120
<i>he used Quirks but injured himself</i>
<i>in the process.</i>

20:04.200 --> 20:06.120
<i>Which means</i>

20:06.210 --> 20:10.540
<i>that when his body receives damage,</i>
<i>it speeds up the Rewind process.</i>

20:23.430 --> 20:26.810
Bring it on non-stop, Hercules!

20:31.440 --> 20:34.650
<i>I'm happy to be of use.</i>

20:35.190 --> 20:37.860
<i>Let's do this. We can do it.</i>

20:38.450 --> 20:42.370
<i>Thrusters: Uravity and Ingenium</i>
<i>at Full Throttle.</i>

20:43.780 --> 20:47.910
<i>Class A, lend me your strength!</i>

21:09.180 --> 21:11.810
Mi… Midoriya…

21:21.450 --> 21:23.160
<i>They're fighting.</i>

21:25.950 --> 21:27.740
<i>All Might!</i>

21:30.460 --> 21:34.040
<i>Let's win, Young Midoriya!</i>

23:20.110 --> 23:21.530
Subtitle translation by: Lili Morita
